== Lore ==
''See [[Lore#General|Springlands Lore]]''

== Enemies ==
As the starting region of [[Embervale]], the '''Springlands''' is populated by all the major enemy factions of [[Enshrouded]]. The area primarily features [[:c:Fell|Fell]], [[:c:Scavenger|Scavengers]], and wild creatures, but also serves as an introduction to the [[:c:Hollow|Hollow]] and the [[:c:Vukah|Vukah]].

The first and most notable enemies in the Springlands are the [[:c:Fell|Fell]], a group of humans and wildlife corrupted by the [[Shroud]]. They are first encountered in the caves after exiting the Cinder Vault, and will thereafter be found in all areas within the Shroud. They are the game's primary antagonists and the main source of {{item+iconright|Shroud Spores}} and {{item+iconright|Torn Cloth}}.

[[:c:Scavenger|Scavengers]] are human survivors corrupted by prolonged use of the [[Elixir]]. They are likely first encountered in the area immediately north of Braelyn Bridge. They can frequently be found in ruined towns above the Shroud, such as {{MapLink | icon= Village | Rookmore | Rookmore | size= 25px }} and {{MapLink | icon= Village | Wescott | Wescott| size= 25px }}, and are the primary source of {{item+iconright|Metal Scraps}}.

Wildlife found in the Springlands are typical woodland creatures of suitable difficulty for new players. Two tameable critters - the {{item+iconright|Hophare}} and the {{item+iconright|Common Goat}} - inhabit the Springland's forests and fields. [[Wolf|Wolves]] are the most common hostile creatures and are frequently found roaming in packs. Other hostile animals can be encountered at specific points of interest, including [[Rat]]s (ruins), [[Spider]]s (crypts), and [[Bat]]s (caves and cemeteries). 

Of the two rarer enemy factions, the [[:c:Vukah|Vukah]] are an ancient civilization of beastmen that represent the last remnants of nature above the Shroud. They are only found at {{MapLink | icon= Village | FortKelvin | Fort Kelvin | size= 25px }} in the Springlands proper but also maintain a presence around {{MapLink | icon= Enemy Camp | VukahCeremonyHill | Vukah Ceremony Hill | size= 25px }} in the Low Meadows. They are a source of {{item+iconright|Animal Fur}} and {{item+iconright|Resin}}.

Finally, the [[:c:Hollow|Hollow]] are undead humans and creatures cursed by [[The Flame]]. They are rare outside of certain cemeteries and catacombs such as the {{MapLink | icon= Sun Temple | Necropolis | Necropolis | size= 25px }}, but serve as the main enemies of the {{MapLink | icon= Hollow Halls | HollowHalls-Springlands | Springlands Hollow Halls | size= 25px }}. They are an excellent source of {{item+iconright|Bones}} and {{item+iconright|Salt}}.

