== Enemies ==
Wildlife unique to the '''Nomad Highlands''' include the hostile [[Sabertooth Tiger]] and the peaceful [[Highlands Roadrunner]]. A hostile, [[Fell Mushroom Crab|Fell variant of the Mushroom Crab]] from the '''Revelwood''' can be found patrolling Shrouded areas of the '''Nomad Highlands'''. [[Bat]]s, [[Rat]]s, and [[Spider]]s are also present.

Settlements in the '''Nomad Highlands''' are largely inhabited by [[:c:Scavenger|Scavengers]], [[:c:Vukah|Vukah]], or [[:c:Fell|Fell]]. There are numerous [[:c:Vukah|Vukah]] camps and cave passages throughout the zone. [[:c:Hollow|Hollow]] can be found at a small graveyard in the north-west and the neighboring {{MapLink | icon= Sun Temple | Catacombs-Highlands1 | Catacombs | size= 25px }}.

